      "body": "PPAP Automotive Limited reaffirmed earnings guidance for the financial year 2026. For the year 2026, the company remain confident of achieving its stated revenue guidance with financial year 2026 revenues projected at approximately INR 5,750 million. At the PAT level, the company expects to close financial year 2026 with INR 80 million of PAT.",
