      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.05 (down from ₹1.14 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.39b (flat on 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹661.0k (down 96% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0% (down from 1.2% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 60% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
